{
	"FileVersion": 3,
	"Version": 2,
	"VersionName": "0.22.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Megalith",
	"Description": "Unified Unreal Engine MCP server — ~1,400+ actions across 24 in-tree namespaces (Blueprint, Material, Animation, Niagara, Mesh, Editor, Config, Source, Project, UI, GAS, ComboGraph, AI, LogicDriver, Audio, LevelSequence, plus megalith meta / bulk_fill / describe and the Reflection Intelligence set: decision / risk / cppreflect / network / pipeline / reflect). Query `megalith_discover()` for the live count. Experimental town-gen actions register when `bEnableProceduralTownGen=true`. Framework-level `bulk_fill_query` and `describe_query` route to 12 per-namespace adapters for transacted JSON-tree writes and rich schema introspection. Reflection Intelligence layers deterministic decision-record, git-risk, and UE reflection queries on top of the source index. AI-powered asset creation, inspection, and modification.",
	"Category": "Editor",
	"CreatedBy": "tumourlove",
	"CreatedByURL": "https://github.com/tumourlove/megalith",
